-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-2\" data-name=\"section description text\">\n                    Starting price, time estimate and service mode.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.7fr)_0.9fr_0.8fr_0.8fr] gap-x-2 border-b border-[var(--border-default)] px-1 pb-2 text-[9px] font-semibold leading-3 text-[var(--text-muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-3\" data-name=\"table header row\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-3-1\" data-name=\"header label LOOK & PROFESSIONAL\">\n                        LOOK & PROFESSIONAL\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-3-2\" data-name=\"header label FROM KES\">\n                        FROM KES\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-3-3\" data-name=\"header label TIME\">\n                        TIME\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-3-4\" data-name=\"header label MODE\">\n                        MODE\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <article class=\"border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-4\" data-name=\"service row card (Knotless Braids)\">\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.7fr)_0.9fr_0.8fr_0.8fr] gap-x-2 px-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-4-1\" data-name=\"service row grid\">\n                        <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-4-1-1\" data-name=\"service identity cell\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold leading-[1.3] text-[var(--text-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service title text\">\n                                Medium Boho Knotless Braids\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"professional and location text\">\n                               